  "bio": {
    "eyebrow": "About Dr Marsh",
    "heading_lead": "Meet",
    "heading_warm": "Dr Marsh.",
    "paragraphs": [
      "Dr James Marsh (MED0002555136) completed his medical degree at the University of Melbourne. He has worked in several hospital rotations across a range of specialties, including Paediatrics, Psychiatry, and Emergency Medicine, before commencing his career in general practice as a GP Registrar. He is passionate about all areas of general practice, with particular interest in preventative health, chronic disease management, paediatrics and emergency medicine.",
      "In his spare time he enjoys spending time with friends and family as well as in the outdoors."
    ]
  },
